{"t": 1794107633.0984013, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502 \u2014 root cause found\n\nCause: upstream ledger release 2026.11 added a `currency` column to every row. reports/export.py wrote rows with a fixed fieldname list [\"id\", \"amount\"], so csv.DictWriter raised `ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'` on every export and the API returned 502. Confirmed in CloudWatch /ecs/reports-api (eu-west-1) and reproduced locally.\n\nFix: added `currency` to the export fieldnames (appended last, existing id/amount columns unchanged). Verified: rows with and without currency both export cleanly.\n\nNeeds: deploy of reports-api. Watch export error rate after rollout."}, "ok": true}
